This MIT license covers the FIRST-PARTY work in this repository, which is all it contains: the
WinRT entry point and console input layer (src/), the build and packaging tooling (tools/), the
package manifest (package/), and the documentation.

The game project, SAT-R/sa2 (https://github.com/SAT-R/sa2), publishes NO license, so no line of
it is reproduced here - not even as diff context. The two changes it needs are described in
docs/HOW-IT-WORKS.md precisely enough to redo them by hand.

